{"about_the_game":"Speedboat League is a beautiful, fast and intense boat racing game, born on the shoulders of classic arcade boat racers (Wave Race, Eliminator Boat Duel) with a mix of modern day karting games. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace fast and shoot 'em all up with powerful speedboats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHighlights of the game:<br />\r\n- lots of weapons to use with in-game enhance system (it's your choice to fire it now or collect an upgrade and use more powerful weapon)<br />\r\n- tons of unlockables<br />\r\n- 8 stages with mirror variations, giving total of 16 tracks<br />\r\n- game modes like normal race, eliminator or time trial <br />\r\n- local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer up to 8 players<br />\r\n- arcade mode for better solo experince<br />\r\n- boat customization menu - stand out in the crowd!<br />\r\n- beat your best times and show them in online leaderboards<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour speedboat season starts now!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1954210?t=1749489950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1954210?t=1749489950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749489950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749489950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller